  "prefLabel": "Puc 2001.02 Application of Rules",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 2001.02 Application of Rules.\n\n(a) This chapter shall apply to competitive electric power suppliers as defined in Puc 2002.04, and aggregators as defined in Puc 2002.02.\n\n(b) This chapter shall not apply to municipalities operating municipal electric utilities under RSA 38, or to municipalities or counties providing electricity or aggregating within the boundaries of participating municipalities under RSA 53-E, or to utilities as defined in Puc 2002.10.\n\nSource. #7758, eff 9-4-02; ss by #9774-A, eff 8-26-10; ss by #12372, eff 11-1-17; ss by #14576, eff 5-13-26, EXPIRES: 5-13-36",
